  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "30",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Altar of Incense",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Make an altar of acacia wood for burning incense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is to be square, a cubit long and a cubit wide, and two cubits high",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "—its horns of one piece with it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Overlay the top and all the sides and the horns with pure gold, and make a gold molding around it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make two gold rings for the altar below the molding—two on each of the opposite sides—to hold the poles used to carry it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make the poles of acacia wood and overlay them with gold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put the altar in front of the curtain that shields the ark of the covenant law—before the atonement cover that is over the tablets of the covenant law—where I will meet with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Aaron must burn fragrant incense on the altar every morning when he tends the lamps.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must burn incense again when he lights the lamps at twilight so incense will burn regularly before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the generations to come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not offer on this altar any other incense or any burnt offering or grain offering, and do not pour a drink offering on it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Once a year Aaron shall make atonement on its horns. This annual atonement must be made with the blood of the atoning sin offering",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "for the generations to come. It is most holy to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atonement Money",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"When you take a census of the Israelites to count them, each one must pay the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a ransom for his life at the time he is counted. Then no plague will come on them when you number them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Each one who crosses over to those already counted is to give a half shekel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "according to the sanctuary shekel, which weighs twenty gerahs. This half shekel is an offering to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All who cross over, those twenty years old or more, are to give an offering to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rich are not to give more than a half shekel and the poor are not to give less when you make the offering to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to atone for your lives.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Receive the atonement money from the Israelites and use it for the service of the tent of meeting. It will be a memorial for the Israelites before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", making atonement for your lives.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basin for Washing",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Make a bronze basin, with its bronze stand, for washing. Place it between the tent of meeting and the altar, and put water in it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aaron and his sons are to wash their hands and feet with water from it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever they enter the tent of meeting, they shall wash with water so that they will not die. Also, when they approach the altar to minister by presenting a food offering to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they shall wash their hands and feet so that they will not die. This is to be a lasting ordinance for Aaron and his descendants for the generations to come.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Anointing Oil",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Take the following fine spices: 500 shekels",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of liquid myrrh, half as much (that is, 250 shekels) of fragrant cinnamon, 250 shekels",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of fragrant calamus,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "500 shekels of cassia—all according to the sanctuary shekel—and a hin",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of olive oil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make these into a sacred anointing oil, a fragrant blend, the work of a perfumer. It will be the sacred anointing oil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then use it to anoint the tent of meeting, the ark of the covenant law,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the table and all its articles, the lampstand and its accessories, the altar of incense,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the altar of burnt offering and all its utensils, and the basin with its stand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall consecrate them so they will be most holy, and whatever touches them will be holy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Anoint Aaron and his sons and consecrate them so they may serve me as priests.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say to the Israelites, 'This is to be my sacred anointing oil for the generations to come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not pour it on anyone else's body and do not make any other oil using the same formula. It is sacred, and you are to consider it sacred.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever makes perfume like it and puts it on anyone other than a priest must be cut off from their people.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Incense",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses, \"Take fragrant spices—gum resin, onycha and galbanum—and pure frankincense, all in equal amounts,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and make a fragrant blend of incense, the work of a perfumer. It is to be salted and pure and sacred.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grind some of it to powder and place it in front of the ark of the covenant law in the tent of meeting, where I will meet with you. It shall be most holy to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not make any incense with this formula for yourselves; consider it holy to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.30.37",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.30.37"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever makes incense like it to enjoy its fragrance must be cut off from their people.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
